# Cline Rules for AvalynxLightbox

- Always perform development tasks (npm build, npm test) inside the Docker container.
- Use `docker-compose exec -u application web bash` to access the environment.
- All code changes MUST maintain 100% test coverage.
- If a change reduces coverage below 100%, it is considered failed.
- Run `npm test -- --coverage` to verify coverage after every modification.
- Follow the existing project structure and coding style.
- Maintain light-weight, framework-independent JavaScript (only Bootstrap 5+ allowed).
